cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FKG.in Recipe Extraction Verification Pipeline"
type: software
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software release and the accompanying paper."

authors:
  - family-names: Shah
    given-names: Armaan
  - family-names: Gupta
    given-names: "Saransh Kumar"

repository-code: "https://github.com/fkg-india/validating-fkg.in"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-02"

abstract: >
  A five-stage pipeline for validating LLM-extracted recipe data against
  source text, combining schema validation, ingredient vocabulary checks,
  statistical outlier detection, semantic coherence modeling, and
  source-fidelity verification, with a human-in-the-loop correction tool.

keywords:
  - LLM
  - recipe extraction
  - food knowledge graph
  - information extraction
  - verification
  - Indian food
  - FKG.in

